  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water management seminar for Shiraka alumni</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This water management seminar is a follow-up initiative from the Shiraka Training Programme on Water Management. For the seminar, Shiraka Alumni will be invited. This project ensures the participation of three Dutch experts to the water management seminar, organised by the embassy in Algiers. The contribution of the Dutch experts to the water management seminar aims to enhance the understanding regarding water management, water and energy and water and agriculture for Algerian public and private stakeholders active in these fields. Furthermore, their presence and expertise aims to contribute to the identification of challenges and obstacles in the mentioned water domains in Algeria. Lastly, the participation of these experts is also meant to feed into the water mapping study, see the separate PSD-proposal PST25DZ02.</narrative>
  </description>
